        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.334,
            0.726,
            0.353
          ],
          "content": "**Q.1 Write all the integers between the given pairs, in increasing order.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.361,
            0.727,
            0.379
          ],
          "content": "a. 0 and –7 b. –4 and 4 c. –8 and –15 d. –30 and –23"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.389,
            0.31,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a. -6,-5,-4,-3,-2,-1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.479,
            0.389,
            0.628,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": "b. -3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.416,
            0.359,
            0.433
          ],
          "content": "c. -14,-13,-12,-11,-10,-9"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.42,
            0.416,
            0.633,
            0.433
          ],
          "content": "d. -29,-28,-27,-26,-25,-24"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.443,
            0.56,
            0.46
          ],
          "content": "**Q.2 Give three numbers such that their sum is –8.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.471,
            0.456,
            0.488
          ],
          "content": "Ans. One of the combinations is -5,7,-10."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.498,
            0.405,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": "Think of other combinations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.525,
            0.874,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": "**Q.3 There are two dice whose faces have these numbers: –1, 2, –3, 4, –5, 6. The smallest possible sum upon rolling these dice is –10 = (–5) + (–5) and the largest possible sum is 12 = (6)+(6). Some numbers between (–10) and (+12) are not possible to get by adding numbers on these two dice. Find those numbers.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.605,
            0.311,
            0.622
          ],
          "content": "Ans. -9,-7,-5,0,2,7,9,11"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.66,
            0.285,
            0.677
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Q.4 Solve these:"
